This release_2.6.1 branch was created using the commit hash for release 2.6.1
cbcd08fa7de711053a3deec6339ee89cad5d2697
Note that tags were lost when the repo was forked so look in the original repo for release tags and the hash.

It was then build as follows:

cmake -E make_directory build; cd build
cmake .. -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
make install
cd ..
mkdir include
mkdir lib
mkdir release

cp /usr/local/include/unity/unity.h ./include/
cp /usr/local/include/unity/unity_internals.h ./include/
cp /usr/local/lib/libunity.a ./lib

tar cvf 2.6.1_release.tar ./include ./lib
mv 2.6.1_release.tar ./release/

Note: Only the static lib was built. See docs for shared-lib build instructions

add, commit and push the lib and include directories